Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Util|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Quick Note Page|
	Then Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Quick Note Page|

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Add Quick Note
Priority: 2
	Given these variables
		|portletName|Quick Note|
	When Click click At Sidebar Click At Wait For Script the value 'Add' at locator 'ControlMenu#ADD'
	And Panel expand Sidebar Applications Panel
	And Type send Keys Application Search the value '${portletName}' at locator 'NavBar#APPLICATION_SEARCH_FIELD'
	And these variables
		|portletLocator|//span[@data-title="${portletName}" and contains(@class,'add-content-item')]|
	And AssertClick pause Make Visible Assert Text Equals Click At the value 'Add' at locator '${portletLocator}'
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Quick Note Page|
	Then QuickNote add PG
		|noteContent|Test Note Content|